            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"massless-qcd-infrared-rearrangement-and-counterterms\">Massless QCD: infrared rearrangement and counterterms</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Set the quark mass to zero <strong>before</strong> adding the auxiliary mass. This is the\norder used by the <a href=\"https://feyncalc.github.io/FeynCalcExamples/QCD/OneLoop/RenormalizationMassless\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">FeynCalc massless reference</a>.\nIt changes which propagators are massified and therefore changes the\nauxiliary gluon mass counterterm. The physical field and coupling constants\nremain the same.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This notebook reuses the symbolic calculation in the\n<a href=\"?file=hep/qcd_renormalization.py\">massive QCD notebook</a>. Marimo's notebook\ncomposition supplies the generated diagrams, tensor reduction, native IBP\nsolution and counterterm equations; the physics implementation is shared.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
